# #5837: the reachability latch exemption and the split transfer's link obligation.
MODULE: SplitEventuallyLinkedObligationNotRedriven
TARGET: SplitEventuallyLinked
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: only the activation that took the split drives the link; one restarted after the close does not re-drive it from the durable obligation (#5837 transfer condition (b))
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE

--- FIND
LinkDriven == oblig
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the obligation is not re-driven after a restart.
LinkDriven == oblig /\ ~lRestart
--- END
